        <item>
            <title>0.15.89</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:55:48 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>250</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.89</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Claude (and other apps that support MCP) can now work with Corder: give it an audio or video file, such as a Telegram voice message, and Corder transcribes it on your Mac with the on-device model and saves it as a session in your library. Claude can also list, read and search your sessions. To connect, open Settings, Advanced, AI assistants, copy the command and run it once in Terminal.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
